                <pb facs="1151" n="1049" sameAs="frus:frus1935v01/pg1049"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">867.24/56: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in Turkey</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Skinner</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1935-01-15T18:00:00-05:00">January 15, 1935—6
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>4. Your 1, January 14, noon. I should view with disfavor assistance by any agency
                    of this Government in the financing of the sale of arms and implements of war to
                    any foreign government.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
